# Variables on all_metrics: the title, set by ERB code from a variable
# (current_page.data.title = vars.app_runtime_abbr + " Component Metrics").
# Fields, separated by tabs: section, place, text, note (see checks/vars.py)
@	title	Cloud Foundry Component Metrics	L6: the page title, from a variable; the front matter's title (Cloud Foundry component metrics) is replaced
@	h1	Cloud Foundry Component Metrics	L6: the heading that shows the title
